  (text "Every key: R-KEY-PU pulls the register input to 3V3, C-KEY and R-KEY-SER filter it, the switch pulls it to ground.\nInputs C and B are the marker straps (0 and 1): tied straight to the rails, no parts. Input A is a free bit: R-KEY-PU-FREE3 only.\nThe register's inputs, allocation and marker levels: hardware/cluster/key-marker-and-bits/allocation.yaml." (at 40.64 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid e0c94585-61af-532f-8512-c580739abbda))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
